WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:12.763 --> 00:00:13.805
What did it say?

00:00:16.266 --> 00:00:17.267
The voicemail?

00:00:19.019 --> 00:00:20.020
Doesn't matter.

00:00:20.729 --> 00:00:21.897
It was ages ago.

00:00:23.273 --> 00:00:24.274
Matters to me.

00:00:35.577 --> 00:00:36.954
It was something like…

00:00:39.122 --> 00:00:40.123
"Hi, Maeve.

00:00:44.002 --> 00:00:45.712
I'm watching you on TV
right now.

00:00:48.715 --> 00:00:51.426
And I wanted to let you
know how proud I am…

00:00:51.510 --> 00:00:52.678
of you.

00:00:56.890 --> 00:00:58.892
And about how you saying
you had feelings for me

00:00:58.976 --> 00:01:00.394
was all I ever wanted
to hear.

00:01:02.187 --> 00:01:03.397
Cos it's always been you.

00:01:06.692 --> 00:01:07.526
I love you."

00:01:10.153 --> 00:01:12.364
Anyway, it was stupid.

00:01:18.704 --> 00:01:19.538
Did you mean it?

00:01:36.221 --> 00:01:37.264
Did you mean it?

00:01:40.184 --> 00:01:41.268
Of course I meant it.

00:01:58.285 --> 00:02:00.120
I can't… I can't do this.

00:02:00.204 --> 00:02:01.121
Okay.

00:02:01.830 --> 00:02:02.831
I understand.

00:02:12.174 --> 00:02:14.510
I don't… I don't
wanna lose you again.

00:02:16.512 --> 00:02:18.847
I'm confused.
This is confusing me.

00:02:46.291 --> 00:02:47.376
Wake up!

00:02:48.293 --> 00:02:49.336
Are you okay?

00:02:49.920 --> 00:02:50.838
What happened?

00:02:50.921 --> 00:02:52.798
You fainted.

00:02:54.633 --> 00:02:55.467
Okay.

00:02:56.635 --> 00:02:57.511
Yeah. Give me your hand.

00:02:57.594 --> 00:02:59.346
And the other one too.
Come on.

00:02:59.930 --> 00:03:00.764
Come on, you got this.

00:03:00.848 --> 00:03:02.558
There you go.
And you're up.

00:03:02.641 --> 00:03:04.059
Okay, now do you want me
to call someone?

00:03:04.142 --> 00:03:04.977
Get you some water?

00:03:06.019 --> 00:03:07.479
No, I'm okay.

00:03:08.438 --> 00:03:09.273
You sure?

00:03:16.196 --> 00:03:17.239
Oh my God.

00:03:21.535 --> 00:03:22.786
Oh my God!

00:03:22.870 --> 00:03:24.121
Oh, okay.

00:03:26.665 --> 00:03:27.541
Hey!

00:03:28.375 --> 00:03:29.501
Stop that!

00:03:30.043 --> 00:03:31.420
Two more laps for you,
Covey.

00:03:33.213 --> 00:03:34.548
-Thank you.
-Wait… wow.

00:03:35.465 --> 00:03:36.800
I…

00:03:39.344 --> 00:03:40.512
Lara Jean.

00:03:49.062 --> 00:03:49.938
I had a lot of fun tonight.

00:03:51.064 --> 00:03:52.774
-Yeah, me too.
-Yeah.

00:04:15.631 --> 00:04:16.757
Dude, you're blowing it.

00:04:16.840 --> 00:04:18.592
You're blowing it.

00:04:18.675 --> 00:04:19.760
Okay.

00:04:19.843 --> 00:04:21.428
Hey, Vivian.
Vivian, wait, wait.

00:04:22.721 --> 00:04:24.598
No. Look, it's fine, okay?

00:04:24.681 --> 00:04:26.517
I was just confused.
You don't have to…

00:04:26.600 --> 00:04:27.768
run out of your car
about it.

00:04:27.851 --> 00:04:28.685
I like you.

00:04:29.978 --> 00:04:31.355
A lot. I do.

00:04:31.897 --> 00:04:33.815
I don't know. I got
all in my head about it.

00:04:33.899 --> 00:04:35.984
You know,
I started worrying that

00:04:36.068 --> 00:04:37.611
maybe I shouldn't
come off too strong.

00:04:37.694 --> 00:04:39.821
You know, you're like this
super powerful feminist and…

00:04:39.905 --> 00:04:41.740
you're not just a cute girl.

00:04:41.823 --> 00:04:43.575
I mean, you are a cute girl,
don't get me wrong.

00:04:57.089 --> 00:04:59.091
-Okay.
-All right.

00:05:10.227 --> 00:05:12.104
-So--
-I'm so sorry.

00:05:14.064 --> 00:05:15.399
I'm so sorry. It was…

00:05:15.482 --> 00:05:17.776
I
didn't think properly about
what I was doing and...

00:05:18.527 --> 00:05:20.487
It was a stupid thing to do.

00:05:20.571 --> 00:05:21.864
I don't want you to feel
awkward about it.

00:05:21.947 --> 00:05:23.240
-It was all my fault.
-Charlie, hang on.

00:05:23.323 --> 00:05:24.408
I shouldn't have kissed you.

00:05:25.450 --> 00:05:27.202
I bet you just
felt pressured to do it

00:05:27.286 --> 00:05:28.287
because I asked,

00:05:28.370 --> 00:05:30.664
and you probably don't want
to talk to me every again,

00:05:30.747 --> 00:05:32.082
but I at least
had to say sorry.

00:05:33.584 --> 00:05:34.501
See if maybe
there's a chance

00:05:34.585 --> 00:05:36.128
-we can still be friends?
-Charlie.

00:05:36.211 --> 00:05:37.045
I don't want to lose you.

00:05:37.129 --> 00:05:38.839
-I did something stupid.
-Charlie.

00:06:01.111 --> 00:06:02.029
Give me your jacket.

00:06:02.654 --> 00:06:03.864
Oh, okay.

00:06:04.448 --> 00:06:05.324
I want to see

00:06:05.824 --> 00:06:06.867
if you can just

00:06:07.492 --> 00:06:08.869
react to what I do.

00:06:08.952 --> 00:06:10.120
Oh, I don't remember

00:06:10.204 --> 00:06:12.456
signing up
for a dance lesson tonight.

00:06:12.539 --> 00:06:13.916
You're really gonna
turn down a free lesson

00:06:13.999 --> 00:06:16.210
from the best dancer
in the state?

00:06:16.293 --> 00:06:17.419
Oh, I would never.

00:06:17.961 --> 00:06:19.463
Do you know him?
Is he coming or…?

00:06:19.546 --> 00:06:20.506
Okay.

00:06:21.131 --> 00:06:24.051
You don't have to be
in control all the time.

00:06:24.134 --> 00:06:27.638
You're not studying
for a midterm, all right?

00:06:28.388 --> 00:06:30.182
You can't think your way
through this.

00:06:31.099 --> 00:06:32.184
Quinn, you gotta…

00:06:33.101 --> 00:06:34.436
let your body drive you.

00:06:37.356 --> 00:06:38.190
Okay.

00:06:39.983 --> 00:06:40.901
Show me what to do.

00:08:07.654 --> 00:08:08.614
So how's your knee?

00:08:08.697 --> 00:08:10.782
I read this article
in The New England…

00:08:32.513 --> 00:08:33.639
Oh, sorry!

00:08:34.264 --> 00:08:36.141
Sorry. Oh, muscles!

00:08:38.685 --> 00:08:41.104
Sorry. Okay. Thank you.

00:08:41.772 --> 00:08:43.607
Oh, my God.

00:08:43.690 --> 00:08:47.778
Sorry, I know that you were
probably expecting Olivia,

00:08:47.861 --> 00:08:49.112
so we don't have
to do anything

00:08:49.196 --> 00:08:50.280
if you don't want to.

00:08:51.406 --> 00:08:54.159
Truth be told, I've never
kissed anyone before.

00:08:54.243 --> 00:08:55.661
It's not that
I haven't wanted to,

00:08:55.744 --> 00:08:56.703
don't get me wrong.

00:08:56.787 --> 00:08:59.706
For example, I punched Ron
Getler in the sixth grade

00:08:59.790 --> 00:09:01.208
during Seven Minutes
in Heaven.

00:09:02.543 --> 00:09:04.127
Sophomore year,
Spring Fling,

00:09:04.211 --> 00:09:06.630
I was dancing
with Randy Melrose.

00:09:07.130 --> 00:09:08.674
You know,
a romantic song came on,

00:09:08.757 --> 00:09:11.385
I was like, "Oh, it's gonna
happen!" But… until…

00:09:11.468 --> 00:09:12.886
It just didn't 'cause--

00:09:17.850 --> 00:09:19.434
This isn't so bad.

00:09:20.352 --> 00:09:21.728
Not so bad at all.

00:09:22.521 --> 00:09:23.355
Wait!

00:10:00.601 --> 00:10:01.435
There…

00:10:16.658 --> 00:10:19.286
Everyone… everyone
just saw that, didn't they?

00:10:19.369 --> 00:10:20.204
Yup.

00:11:08.669 --> 00:11:09.753
I'm not…

00:11:11.713 --> 00:11:14.007
I'm not-- Hey, wait!

00:11:19.888 --> 00:11:22.057
I'm not-- Sorry, I'm not…

00:12:29.041 --> 00:12:30.667
Why didn't you tell me
the real reason

00:12:31.210 --> 00:12:32.377
you got that black eye?

00:12:35.172 --> 00:12:36.757
It didn't seem important.

00:12:37.341 --> 00:12:38.926
Okay, but you…

00:12:39.009 --> 00:12:40.552
you, like, defended
my honour

00:12:40.636 --> 00:12:42.763
and you took a punch for me.

00:12:43.388 --> 00:12:44.264
Yeah, well…

00:12:45.057 --> 00:12:46.975
Yeah, well,
I guess I did that.

00:12:51.730 --> 00:12:52.564
What?

00:12:54.233 --> 00:12:55.150
Nothing.

00:12:56.944 --> 00:12:58.987
I'm just making
some mental revisions

00:12:59.071 --> 00:13:01.573
to my perfect boyfriend
checklist.

00:13:03.450 --> 00:13:05.244
Well, did I make it
over 50%?

00:13:06.370 --> 00:13:07.704
Way over.

00:13:15.963 --> 00:13:16.839
But, you know,

00:13:16.922 --> 00:13:18.966
the only major
sticking point

00:13:19.049 --> 00:13:20.133
is the milk crate.

00:13:20.926 --> 00:13:23.303
I really don't get
why you don't just

00:13:23.387 --> 00:13:25.222
put your stuff in a backpack

00:13:25.305 --> 00:13:26.557
like a normal person.

00:13:28.308 --> 00:13:30.644
Well, because,
I knew the day would come

00:13:30.727 --> 00:13:31.728
where I would need it,

00:13:31.812 --> 00:13:33.480
and I wanted to be ready.

00:13:35.440 --> 00:13:36.608
Ready for what?

00:13:52.916 --> 00:13:53.792
For this.

